    "slug": "adverse-impact",
    "term": "Adverse impact",
    "set": "prism",
    "txt": "adverse impact a materially different outcome rate for a protected group, which carries legal consequence as well as reputational. bias prism",
    "def": "A materially different outcome rate for a protected group, which carries legal consequence as well as reputational.",
